*  s188 seat4 REDUCTION of fz_segv_18 (row fuzz-segv-batch).  MECHANISM: M2 SEALED CAPTURED GENERATOR (the capture wraps the DEFER)
*  Necessary ingredients, each measured by ablation: FENCE + defer + the capture placed AROUND the deferred reference + a following element. Inline the same text GREEN; drop the FENCE GREEN; drop the outer capture GREEN.
          G0            =  FENCE(ARB)
          P             =  (*G0) . v1 TAB(2)
          'a b c' *P RPOS(0)                          :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match'                      :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
